public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Lyons.GebhardtPresentation
public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Lyons.Atlas111WordRelations.Arithmetic

/-!
# Fixed signed matrices for Gebhardt certificates

Ten explicit radix-3125 row tables record the five candidate images and
their inverse candidates. These definitions assert no word identity,
invertibility, relation, order, or group identification. The independent
image and product certificates share precisely these fixed inputs.

Source: Gebhardt, Experimental Mathematics 9 (2000), 333-338,
Section 3B; original ATLAS matrices in `Atlas111Source/`. Generated
by `GebhardtMatrixSource/GenerateCertificateInputs.py`.
-/

namespace Lyons.Gebhardt.MatrixRealization.CertificateInputs

